tool.output_format:
{
  load_1min: float,   # 1-minute load average
  load_5min: float,   # 5-minute load average
  load_15min: float,  # 15-minute load average
  cpu_count: int,     # Number of CPUs (compare load to this)
  memory: { total, used, free, available }
}

Interpretation: load > cpu_count means system is overloaded
